<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0AA124008001" page = "2">
<title>
Scan Tool Data Definitions
</title>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008002">
<title>
Battery Voltage (V)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates battery voltage detected by RBS control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008003">
<title>
Detecting Distance (m)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates distance to a vehicle ahead when millimeter wave radar detects the vehicle.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008004">
<title>
RBS Warning Timing (FAR)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter is indicated all the time without change.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008005">
<title>
Object Detection Status (ON / OFF)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates whether or not millimeter wave radar detects a vehicle ahead.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008006">
<title>
Radar Visibility (OK / NG)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates state of millimeter wave radar visibility judged by RBS control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008007">
<title>
RBS Control Module Temperature Condition (OK / NG)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates internal temperature of RBS control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008008">
<title>
RBS Control Module Voltage Condition (OK / NG)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates power supply voltage of RBS control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008009">
<title>
ABS/ESP&#174; Control Module Condition (OK / NG)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates state of automatic brake function control transmitted from ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008010">
<title>
Outside Air Temperature Condition (OK / NG)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter indicates state of outside air temperature sensor transmitted from BCM.
</ptxt>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124008011">
<title>
RBS OFF Switch (OFF)
</title>
<ptxt>
This parameter is indicated all the time without change.
</ptxt>
</topic>
</servinfosub>
